   "lines": [
    "This being out of my",
    "own room has broken",
    "up my regular habits",
    "a good deal, and cut",
    "into my studying",
    "and exercise. Kind",
    "though the two Charlies",
    "are I find it rather",
    "difficult to get my",
    "hours arranged to suit",
    "me; and spend more",
    "time in the club than",
    "I ought to, playing",
    "whist and billiards,",
    "and at partridge",
    "suppers."
   ],
